# Bin Folder: Build & Automation Scripts for {{slug}} plugin

This folder contains all build, test, and automation scripts:

- `build.sh.mustache`: Build assets.
- `test.sh.mustache`: Run all tests (JS, E2E).
- `install-wp-tests.sh.mustache`: Set up WP PHPUnit environment.
- `update-version.js.mustache`: Update version numbers.
- `replace-placeholders.js.mustache`: Replace mustache placeholders in source files.

Scripts use mustache placeholders.  
See `../docs/PLACEHOLDER-WORKFLOW.md.mustache`.